19793::$$$message_0155_0000_0000$$$::"Tawakya! I have no more supplies to spare thee![lr]::
19794::$$$message_0155_0000_0001$$$::'Tis with great regret I must declare that that's all for today![lr]::
19795::$$$message_0155_0000_0002$$$::Come back and challenge me again when you feel like it!"::
19796::$$$message_0155_0001_0000$$$::"...She's gone."[lr]::
19797::$$$message_0155_0001_0001$$$::The Quiz Fiend vanishes into thin air.[lr]::
19798::$$$message_0155_0001_0002$$$::What fearsome divine power.[lr]::
19799::$$$message_0155_0001_0003$$$::[se volume=50 storage=se073.wav]She's probably just hiding in the ruins, but I'll leave it at that.::
19800::$$$message_0155_0002_0000$$$::I look up and see red above.[lr]::
19801::$$$message_0155_0002_0001$$$::With regret, I trudge back to the castle. I've never wasted this much time before.::
919793::$$$message_9155_0000_0000$$$::"Tawakya! I have no more supplies to spare thee!"[r]:ív